From 4e6b70ea7b811b700bc81472c16c40c86896aa8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:32:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] test(edm): sinker suites on main's EDM designs;
 recorded sinker-iso refusals take the script's form

- script_sinker_iso: SinkerCondition stream; new refusals pinned (an
  orbit, a side burn, an unlisted condition); a non-sinker post on a
  sinker burn meets the SinkerCondition door, the sinker post on a mill
  its own machine check.
- recorded golden/sinker-iso/*.refusal: the nine mill cases now refuse
  as the script's counted warnings instead of the dropped engine
  serves_gate's stop (still never released); css_then_live and
  live_then_stop (main's new cases) recorded in the same form. The sinker
  burn's programs are byte-identical.
- app: the serves door's text for a sinker through a milling post
  (sinker_burn, sinker_burn_held, wire_post), the sinker post's own
  refusal on a plasma table, and an orbit / side burn stream test.

Refs #542

